{
  "$schema": "../../../../docs/catalog/schema/package.schema.json",
  "id": "Lyo.Cli",
  "name": "Lyo.Cli",
  "area": "Tools",
  "tagline": "Installable `lyo` CLI that covers encryption, encoding, compression, hashing, IDs, query build/exec, and CSV/XLSX.",
  "description": "A `PackAsTool` dotnet tool (command name `lyo`) over Lyo libraries. **crypt** handles encryption (Lyo.Encryption); **enc** handles binary/charset encoding (Lyo.TextEncoding). The remaining verbs are **compress**/**decompress**, **hash**/**checksum**, **id**, **query build|exec**, and **csv**/**xlsx**. No dedicated CLI test project exists. System.CommandLine parses arguments; package tests cover library behavior.",
  "features": [
    "**crypt.** Single-key encrypt/decrypt (aesgcm default; file or pipe)",
    "**enc.** Base64 / base64url / hex encode and decode; charset convert/detect",
    "**compress** / **decompress.** Every Lyo.Compression algorithm (brotli default)",
    "**hash** / **checksum.** SHA-2/MD5, HMAC-SHA256, CRC/Adler, sparse fingerprint; `-o`, `-c/--copy`, `-q/--quiet`",
    "**id.** ULID, KSUID, NanoID, GUID variants, Snowflake; `-n/--count` for a batch; `-c/--copy` clipboard",
    "**query build|exec.** Lyo.Query.Models builders plus a Lyo.Api.Client POST",
    "**csv** / **xlsx.** Merge, split, convert, stats (xlsx→csv is native; csv→xlsx goes through DataTable glue)"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Install on this machine",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "python3 scripts/cli/pack_install.py pack-install\nlyo --help"
    },
    {
      "title": "Hash from stdin",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "cat file.bin | lyo hash sha256"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mint a batch of IDs",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "lyo id ulid -n 10\nlyo id guid v7 --count 5 -c -q"
    },
    {
      "title": "Hash and copy the digest",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "lyo hash sha256 file.bin -c"
    },
    {
      "title": "Workbook stats",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "lyo xlsx stats workbook.xlsx\nlyo xlsx stats workbook.xlsx --sheet Sheet1"
    },
    {
      "title": "Build a query payload",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "lyo query build concrete --where Status:eq:Active --amount 20 -o req.json"
    },
    {
      "title": "Encrypt and decrypt through a pipe",
      "language": "bash",
      "code": "lyo crypt encrypt secret.bin -o - --key 'passphrase' | lyo crypt decrypt - --key 'passphrase' > plain.bin"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Pack and install",
      "text": "The library pack (`scripts/nuget/build_nuget.py`) skips `Tools/`. Pack the tool with `dotnet pack Lyo.Net/Tools/Lyo.Cli/Lyo.Cli.csproj -c Release -o artifacts/cli` then `dotnet tool install -g Lyo.Cli --add-source artifacts/cli`, or use `python3 scripts/cli/pack_install.py pack-install`."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Copy to clipboard (`-c/--copy`)",
      "text": "Works on `id` and `hash`/`checksum` text results. Talks to native OS tools through Process stdin: Windows `clip`, macOS `pbcopy`, Linux `wl-copy` / `xclip` / `xsel`. No TextCopy package. For bulk IDs: `-n/--count N` (one ID per line; all copied together when using `-c`)."
    }
  ],
